  "question": {
    "text": "<p>Choose the halogen which is most reactive towards SN1 reaction in the given compounds (A, B, C &amp; D)</p><p>A.&nbsp;<img src=\"assets\\qt0054_97a739fc9ef1.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 146px;\" /></p><p>B.&nbsp;<img src=\"assets\\qt0054_49c52793c584.png\" style=\"width: 250px; height: 54px;\" /></p><p>C.&nbsp;<img src=\"assets\\qt0054_e74ddc55f151.png\" style=\"width: 200px; height: 150px;\" /></p><p>D.&nbsp;<img src=\"assets\\qt0054_47cf2f14ff8d.png\" style=\"width: 218px; height: 108px;\" /></p>"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>Br</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">B</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">I</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>Br</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></msub><mo>;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">D</mi><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>Br</mi><mrow><mo>(</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>)</mo></mrow></msub></math>",
